hemakumbhasthitaṃ svacchaṃ gaṅgādi saridāhṛtam।
snānārthaṃ salilaṃ devi gṛhyatāṃ sāgarātmaje।।
śrīvaralakṣmyai namaḥ snānaṃ samarpayāmi।।
